  "all_ingredients_flat": "potatoes, carrot, green peas, Ezekiel 4:9 bread, coriander leaves, garam masala, lemon, dry mango powder, salt, green hot chillies, Ezekiel 4:9 bread crumbs",
  "instructions": "DOUGH: Pressure cook 5 small potatoes mixed with 1 carrot & 1 cup fresh green peas. Mash them together after they cool down. Crumble & add 1 slice Ezekiel 4:9 bread to bind. Add freshly minced coriander leaves. Add spices (to taste): garam masala, lemon or dry mango powder, salt (optional). For extra spiciness, add minced green hot chillies. BAKE: Make flat balls using the dough. If the dough is lumpy, add extra Ezekiel 4:9 bread crumbs for binding. Preheat air fryer at 390F for 5 mins. Air fry at 390F for 8 mins on one side. Flip the patties over. Air fry for another 7 mins to cook the other side.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "cook",
    "no-cook",
    "air-fry"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "",
  "notes": "CUTLETS. For extra spiciness, add minced green hot chillies.",
